SUMMARY:When -5 — Where
DESCRIPTION:When: Wednesday 16 April: 4pm-5.30pm GMT\\n\\nComing Wednesday
  I have the honour to speak at one of the onboarding events from Holistic
  Systems Cooperative - a thriving ecosystem of professionals\, entreprene
 urs\, and changemakers gathering to pool resources\, exchange value\, dev
 elop meaningful work & drive societal transformation.\n\nIn this specific
  session I will dive into the art and practice of articulating our needs 
 and sharing our gifts. \n\nWhat: Offers & Needs: Community Economy Onboar
 ding\nWhen: Wednesday 16 April: 4pm-5.30pm GMT\nWhere: https://hscooperat
 ive.com/events/offers-needs-community-economy-onboarding-with-bart-april-
 16/\n\nJoin if you'd like to learn more about this topic\, or feel drawn 
