SUMMARY:Fri 6 June WAT JED I are hosting African Builder Spotlight live X 
 Spaces no panel just ope
DESCRIPTION:Today (Fri 6 June\, 7 PM WAT) JED and I are hosting 
 an African Builder Spotlight live on X Spaces—no IRL panel\, just
  an open community discussion you can join from wherever you are.\\n\\nst
 arting in an hour: (following text is copied written by Maceo:\n\nhttps:/
 /x.com/1jedxo/status/1931011473586708570\n\n\nHey 👋🏾—quick head
 s‑up!\n\nToday (Fri 6 June\, 7 PM WAT) JED and I are hosting 
 an African Builder Spotlight live on X Spaces—no IRL panel\, just
  an open community discussion you can join from wherever you are.\n\nSpot
 light guest: Web3 Afrika—three years strong\, all‑volunteer\, Lagos
 ‑based. Expect grassroots hacks\, shared wins\, and lessons on purpose
 ‑driven community building.\n\nWho’s sending this? We Them Media
 —a Pan‑African media DAO amplifying African creators and onboarding t
 he next wave of builders into Web3. Our goal: empower 20 K+ on‑chain 
 creatives and foster sustainable\, community‑owned media hubs across Af
 rica and the diaspora.\n\n👉 Hop straight into the X Space: https:/
 /x.com/i/spaces/1PlKQMrdwnDKE\n👉 Or set a Discord reminder & pull up
 : https://discord.gg/qKNzUfqH?event=1379030942143877140\n\nFeel free to p
 ass this along to anyone who’d vibe with African builders driving Web3 
 forward! 💜\\n\\nSource: https://t.me/civilmonkey/125
URL:https://t.me/civilmonkey/125
CATEGORIES:civil notes
END:VEVENT
