SUMMARY:Deadline: 26 hours left to allocate your rewards Octant Epoch 9
DESCRIPTION:26 hours left to allocate your rewards in Octant Epoch 9\\n\\n
 26 hours left to allocate your rewards in Octant Epoch 9 \nif you already
  have locked $glm locked please go to octant.app/projects to select a few
  projects to allocate your rewards to\nif you don’t have $glm locked an
 d you want to see impactful web3-enabled solutions utilized please fel fr
 e to remind others who may have locked $glm to allocate. the current Ethe
 reum storytellers epoch 9 has gotten more visibility than any previous ep
 och\, Octant is making its way into broader crypto (twitter) and yet only
  half as many donors as in the climate epoch (e7) have allocated yet. The
  30 creator projects in tis epoch are telling stories of Ethereum in ways
  much closer to the original crypto ethos and more intune with the existi
 ng web3 world than most crypto stories in the media. Stories are what mov
 es people\, what changes sentiment\, what opens doors. While the effects 
 may not be immediately measurable\; when the 30 storytellers in this epoc
 h win\, we all win. If you have $glm locked you taking 2 minutes to selec
 t a few projects to allocate to will effect at least hundreds of dollars 
 going to proven projects without a single cent leaving your own pocket.\n
 \n\n\neach project will speak for 5min soon:\n…\\n\\nSource: https://t.
 me/civilmonkey/177
URL:https://t.me/civilmonkey/177
CATEGORIES:civil notes
END:VEVENT
