SUMMARY:It s it s — I m excited to announce that I ll be co-organizing s
 everal artizen.fund activations around
DESCRIPTION:It’s happening and it’s happening today\\n\\nGuten Morgen 
 Berlin 🙂\n\nIt’s happening and it’s happening today\n\nI’m excit
 ed to announce that I’ll be co-organizing several artizen.fund activati
 ons in and around Berlin over the next few weeks\n\nStarting with 7pm ton
 ight co-hosting ‚Artizen Awakening‘ with local signers\, dance perfor
 mers\, several experienced creators on Artizen\, finger food\, drinks and
  a DJ on roller skates with her own radio station \nhttps://luma.com/7u0y
 yaqi\n\nIt’s happening right after the full day Neocypherpunk Summit th
 at is happening right now at Funkhaus in Berlin where human rights and di
 gital rights activists meet today\nI encourage you to come by if you’re
  in the area and share this info with people you know in/around Berlin\n\
 nJune 14th 10am-7pm Neocypherpunk Summit:\nhttps://s26ber.web3privacy.inf
 o/ \nhttps://luma.com/f47k4xnd?tk=CRwKdg \nSign up to volunteer: https://
 tally.so/r/3lLqKo via https://x.com/web3privacy/status/205522726562181989
 4?s=46\n This will be wherehuman rights & digital rights activists are me
 eting - great convergences and line-up tbh\n\n\nMore events in Berlin thi
 s week below\n\n\nIn a few weeks at the end of season 6 on Artizen we’r
 e hosting artizenvillage.com at dwebcamp.org https://getdweb.net/p…\\n\
 \nSource: https://t.me/civilmonkey/248
URL:https://t.me/civilmonkey/248
CATEGORIES:civil notes
END:VEVENT
