SUMMARY:My news for are I successfully created pool gardens.fund
DESCRIPTION:My news for today are: I successfully created a pool on garden
 s.fund\\n\\ndo you ever clean nature from trash? if so\, this is for you:
 \n\nMessage from @luminaenvision  from Greenpill Phangan:\nMy news for to
 day are: I successfully created a pool on gardens.fund \n\nWhoever joined
  our gardens\, please activate governance\, you will need it to vote on p
 roposals. Whoever feels to add more funds - of course you are welcome to 
 do so as well 😇 we are working with cUSD\, right now I have 700 cUSD i
 n the pool thanks to Ethereum for the World \n\nhttps://app.gardens.fund/
 gardens/42220/0x6068dfc4f2aeca09d8d5845896f3aa76d0fe6960/0x86b5da0cd4c9ec
 00145bc763e44d12ad9ffb2cbb\n\nYou are welcome to create proposal for your
  cleanup as well\, but the first step is to actually submit it on dapp.de
 cleanup.net\, not skipping the impact report form (generally it’s optio
 nal)\, but you are allowed to skip submitting recycables step. Cleanup mu
 st be done not earlier than one month before the date of submission \n\nT
 hen you can create proposal about your cleanup (read the template in the 
 proposal description) \n\nIf you still didn’t join gardens\, but you wa
 nt to do so\, contact me in DM\, I will figure out if you are eligible fo
 r receiving $cDCU tokens to join (and I believe all of you are eligible a
 s…\\n\\nSource: https://t.me/civilmonkey/251
URL:https://t.me/civilmonkey/251
CATEGORIES:civil notes
END:VEVENT
