SUMMARY:is weekly Momentum Artizen call which is best way to understand Ar
 tizen more Attending cal
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow 7pmCET is the weekly Monday Momentum Artizen online c
 all which is the best way to understand Artizen more https://luma.com/mon
 day-momentum-59?tk=VjuDNH Attending the call also give you the chance to 
 earn boost points just for attending 🙂\\n\\nHello there 🙂\n\nFundin
 g inbetweeners\, people acting purely intrinsically motivated between org
 anizations\, has been on my mind a lot. One of the reasons for that is th
 at I am an inbetweener and have volunteered most of my time and energy ov
 er the last few years.\n\n\nThrough helping more and more people make sen
 se of Artizen\, I have finally created my own project and see this as a c
 hance to showcase how ecosystem weavers aka inbetweeners can be funded st
 arting with the bold experiment of resourcing myself.\n\nWould you like t
 o be a part of this story?\n\nThis is the week I am asking for your suppo
 rt to climb the leaderboard as high as possible.\n\nYou can support by bu
 ying artifacts or giving boost points.\n( Tip if you feel like you have t
 o click once for every boost you want to\n\n\nhttps://artizen.fund/index/
 p/civil-monkey-ecosystem-weaving?season=7\n\ngive: Clicking faster on the
  boost button increases the speed of giving boost points)\n\n\n\n\nTomorr
 ow 7pmCET is the weekly Monday Momentum Artizen online call which is the 
 best way to understand Artizen more https://luma.com/monday-momentum-59?t
 k=VjuDNH Attending the call also give you the chance to earn boost points
  just for attending 🙂\n\n\n\nAdditiona…\\n\\nSource: https://t.me/ci
 vilmonkey/254
URL:https://t.me/civilmonkey/254
CATEGORIES:civil notes
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:civilmonkey-254-1-23f5a99eb2@telegram
DTSTAMP:20261030T160449Z
DTSTART:20260816T180000Z
DTEND:20260816T190000Z
SUMMARY:Deadline: Additionally to main leaderboard I aim to finish first r
 ank displayed home page artizen.fu
DESCRIPTION:Additionally to the main leaderboard I aim to finish on first 
 rank this coming Thursday (Aug20) displayed on the home page artizen.fund
 : there is a quest with its own leaderboard today closing in a little ove
 r an hour at 8pmCET where I currently have the chance of getting on the p
 odium by selling more artifacts on Artizen.\\n\\nHello there 🙂\n\nFund
 ing inbetweeners\, people acting purely intrinsically motivated between o
 rganizations\, has been on my mind a lot. One of the reasons for that is 
 that I am an inbetweener and have volunteered most of my time and energy 
 over the last few years.\n\n\nThrough helping more and more people make s
 ense of Artizen\, I have finally created my own project and see this as a
  chance to showcase how ecosystem weavers aka inbetweeners can be funded 
 starting with the bold experiment of resourcing myself.\n\nWould you like
  to be a part of this story?\n\nThis is the week I am asking for your sup
