SUMMARY:Deadline: Go to artizen.fund fill out payment form end of November
  to get money of artifacts you sol
DESCRIPTION:Go to artizen.fund and fill out the payment  form until end of
  November to get the money of the artifacts you sold if you had a project
  on the platform. The downside of  requesting the payout this way is that
  you wave your rights to claim more payouts e.g. of match funding & cash 
 prizes projects were promised & expecting. My personal opinion is that th
 e most likely way to get some money out is to hand in the payment request
  instead of speculating of a potentially successful lawsuit that may resu
 lt in a higher payout. I could be wrong with this assessment. This is not
  legal or financial advice. Please do feel free to consider seeking profe
 ssional legal or financial advice to make your decision. I am sharing my 
 intuition and personal opinion here based on my instincts that have been 
 meaningfully wrong in the last.\\n\\nArtizen is winding down. link curati
 on below\n\n \nAlso in this message: an offering of an upcoming systems c
 hange course and an opportunity for climate start-ups to apply to today\n
 \n\n\nOn Artizen:\n\nhttps://x.com/civilmonkey/status/2108268722854965680
 ?s=46\n\nrecorded online conversation about Artizen - community x space a
 bout the wind down  - hosted by Natalie Crue and Emily Lazar - one of the
  best facilitated conversations on the topic imho https://x.com/nataliecr
 ue/status/2107546478579519787?s=46 \n\n\n thoughts from me and curated li
 nks:\nI am disappointed\, heartbroken\, frustrated that Artizen is coming
  to an unexpected end and as of now won’t fulfill the promises made. I 
 am deeply sorry I encouraged utilizing of it. I am still trying to wrap m
 y head around what is happening.\n\nIf you had a project on Artizen\, ple
 ase take some time rather sooner than later to read through the links sha
 red below \n\ndo read the fine print before signing anything.\n please do
  consider your options:\nif you would like to go the safest (in my opinio
 n) route with the highest likelihood in my opinion it is very much worth 
 considering rquesting the payout before November 30th:\nGo to artizen.fun
 d and fill out the paym…\\n\\nSource: https://t.me/civilmonkey/265
