SUMMARY:call about current farcaster situation with Cassie who has already
  forked farcaster protoc
DESCRIPTION:happening live now: online call about current farcaster situat
 ion with Cassie who has already forked the farcaster protocol into Hypers
 nap and is building Quorum as an app to interact with hyper snap / farcas
 ter protocol:\\n\\nFarcaster got acquired by Network School and the app n
 ow has new rules. Without agreeing to new rules\, it is possible to inter
 act with the farcaster protocol or forks of it through other apps/clients
  mentioned below auch as Quorum and Recaster.\n\n New rules were applied 
 to content previously posted which led to many people being banned who ha
 d previously been key in building the farcaster community - many of them 
 are now moving on to Hypersnap which is a farcaster fork that can be used
  through Quorum.\nThe Farcaster default client is now under control of Ne
 twork School by Balaji\nThe farcaster protocol data can still be read and
  written to from other farcaster clients like Recaster (including full fo
 rks like Quorum) linked below. Network Schoo \nhttps://www.theblock.co/ne
 ws/ecosystems/2026-10-15-network-school-acquires-farcaster-from-neynar-41
 8720\n\nTopic on X:\nhttps://x.com/i/trending/2110811988310036812 \n\nhap
 pening live now: online call about current farcaster situation with Cassi
 e who has already forked the farcaster protocol into Hypersnap and is bui
 lding Quorum as an app to interact with hyper snap / farcaster protocol:\
 nhttps://luma.com/gejm3v7b\n\n\n\nGM farcaster  episode of today\nht…\\
 n\\nSource: https://t.me/civilmonkey/267
URL:https://t.me/civilmonkey/267
CATEGORIES:civil notes
END:VEVENT
