SUMMARY:GM farcaster episode of
DESCRIPTION:GM farcaster  episode of today\\n\\nFarcaster got acquired by 
 Network School and the app now has new rules. Without agreeing to new rul
 es\, it is possible to interact with the farcaster protocol or forks of i
 t through other apps/clients mentioned below auch as Quorum and Recaster.
 \n\n New rules were applied to content previously posted which led to man
 y people being banned who had previously been key in building the farcast
 er community - many of them are now moving on to Hypersnap which is a far
